%chk=probe_h2_smoke.chk
%mem=1GB
%nprocshared=1
#P HF/STO-3G NoSymm Int=NoBasisTransform SCF=(Conver=10)
# Output=(MatrixElement,MO2ElectronIntegrals) Tran=(Full,Force)

probe_h2_smoke: two basis functions, runs in under a second. RUN THIS FIRST. It answers the three questions that gate every other job at once, before any real time is spent: does gauopen's QCMatEl open a file this route produced at all, is there an ALPHA FOCK MATRIX record in it, and is me.itran equal to 5 (a full transformation was done) rather than 0 (no MO integrals were stored). If itran comes back 0 the route is wrong and no other result means anything. E(SCF) should be about -1.117 Ha.

